eVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}]}}}